        "raw": "<p>Hey folks,</p><p>I&#39;ve flipped around and not been able to find a definitive answer on this one. If Kismet has put her talisman on a hero and that hero gets incapacitated, what happens to the amulet? We checked everything and nothing I could see said that it should go back to Kismet. It&#39;s treated like a character card (that we did find in the errata), but do we really get X free turns while Kismet pounds away at an amulet that&#39;s on a downed character? That doesn&#39;t seem at all fair, but considering that we have 7 jinxes on the table, nobody was complaining about the respite...</p><p>Any thoughts?</p>",
